WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.810
So as we continue to await results in many
states, we wonder how many mail in ballots

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:09.980
are out there in various states, we are getting
news that there could be hundreds of thousands

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:14.019
of missing ballots, missing ballots.

00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:21.619
The U.S. Postal Service had a deadline of
yesterday to sweep their mail processing facilities

00:00:21.619 --> 00:00:27.210
in more than a dozen states for missing election
ballots because of reports that ballots were

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.400
just sitting around.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.610
They could be hundreds of thousands of total
ballots.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.300
When you look at some of the margins in the
states still being counted.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.810
You quickly realize hundreds of thousands
of that ballots could make a huge difference.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:47.310
U.S. District Court Judge Emmet Sullivan in
D.C. ordered the sweep Tuesday morning when

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:54.260
the Postal Service said that its delivery
performance was down and they couldn't say

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:59.900
whether more than 300000 ballots received
had been delivered.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:03.620
Well, then you've got to see if the ballots
are still at the postal center.

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:09.710
The sweep was supposed to happen in 12 specific
districts, including in Arizona, Florida,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.650
Georgia, Pennsylvania, Texas, Wisconsin.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:16.960
I think you understand the importance of this.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:22.451
The judge gave the agency until three 30 p.m
to finish the task at four 30, the postal

00:01:22.451 --> 00:01:29.300
service said, sorry, we couldn't do it, would
have disrupted our Election Day activities.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:36.210
They said they would continue a daily review
process to find and deliver smaller amounts

00:01:36.210 --> 00:01:37.620
of ballots.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.420
We don't know how many ballots are currently
missing.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:43.210
The window is closing very quickly.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:51.090
The deadline for mail in ballots depends on
what state you were in, but it was Tuesday

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.060
night in a number of different states.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:59.049
There are reports of undelivered ballots that
have started cropping up even from the past

00:01:59.049 --> 00:02:01.140
weekend, Miami Dade County.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:07.030
Listen, I'm not saying anything in particular,
but Miami-Dade County was expected to be more

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:10.450
pro Biden than the numbers bore out.

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:14.030
And Miami-Dade County is one of the places
where mail in ballots have allegedly gone

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:16.590
undelivered.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:18.310
I'm just giving you the information.

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:23.890
This is a red alert in Pennsylvania alone,
one of every two ballots rejected in the last

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:29.750
election were because of a deadline and the
margin was only 44000 votes by which Donald

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.360
Trump defeated Hillary Clinton.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:35.860
This has to be taken extraordinarily seriously.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:40.300
This is just one example relating to potentially
three hundred thousand ballots that we know

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.300
of.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.300
Look at the margins.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:46.190
This is a potentially election changing number
of ballots.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.920
These ballots could decide a state or two.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:56.319
And these are exactly the ballots that Donald
Trump told us at 2:00 a.m. last night.

00:02:56.319 --> 00:03:02.870
He is going to go all the way up to the Supreme
Court if he needs to, in order to stop the

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:05.180
counting of these ballots.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:11.270
And Donald Trump wasting no time this morning
in starting the conspiracy theories.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.719
Let's talk about that next

